#nop {Generated from the server's own socials file, lib/misc/socials in the}
#nop {RotS source: every social in the game, in both the form you see when}
#nop {you perform one and the form you see when somebody else does.}

#nop {Each pattern is anchored with ^ so it can only match at the start of a}
#nop {line, and the actor is captured as %1 rather than dropped - %0 is the}
#nop {matched text, so without that capture the panel would lose the name.}
#nop {The remaining $-tokens (his/her, him/her, the target) become wildcards.}

#nop {Kept in the socials class so socialsoff can unload the lot.}

#class {socials} {open}

#nop {=== Socials you perform ===}

